WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.700
Narrator: After any incident, you complete an incident report card.

2
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.800
Narrator: Write it as soon as you safely can, while it's fresh.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.500
Narrator: Facts only, in the order they happened.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.600
Narrator: Hand it to your supervisor - and keep it private.

5
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.400
Narrator: It may be read by managers, Security or the police.

